---
import {
  PLATO_CHECKOUT_URL,
  PLATO_PREMIUM_AMOUNT,
  PLATO_PREMIUM_CURRENCY,
} from '../lib/plato-config';
---

<section
  class="mx-auto max-w-lg rounded-2xl border border-dusty-rose/60 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-lg"
  aria-labelledby="plato-gate-title"
>
  <div
    class="mx-auto mb-5 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-deep-teal/10 text-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    🍽️
  </div>

  <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-deep-teal">
    Herramienta premium
  </p>

  <h1
    id="plato-gate-title"
    class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-gunmetal"
  >
    Ups, esta herramienta es exclusiva
  </h1>

  <p class="mb-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-gunmetal/80">
    El Simulador del Plato Interactivo te ayuda a armar comidas con la
    proporción 50-25-25 basada en evidencia, para controlar los picos de
    glucosa en ayunas y tras las comidas.
  </p>

  <ul class="mb-8 space-y-3 text-left text-sm text-gunmetal/85">
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 text-deep-teal" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <span>Lista oficial de alimentos con índice glucémico</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 text-deep-teal" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <span>Plato visual interactivo 50 % verduras · 25 % proteína · 25 % carbohidratos</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="mt-0.5 text-deep-teal" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <span>Sin registro: acceso inmediato tras la compra</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <a
    href={PLATO_CHECKOUT_URL}
    class="plato-gate-cta"
  >
    <span class="plato-gate-cta-text">Desbloquear por</span>
    <span class="plato-gate-cta-price" aria-label={`${PLATO_PREMIUM_AMOUNT} euros`}>
      <span class="plato-gate-cta-amount">{PLATO_PREMIUM_AMOUNT}</span>
      <span class="plato-gate-cta-currency">{PLATO_PREMIUM_CURRENCY}</span>
    </span>
  </a>

  <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-gunmetal/60">
  Pago único · Acceso permanente en este dispositivo
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .plato-gate-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background-color: #e85a4a;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(232, 90, 74, 0.35);
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .plato-gate-cta-text {
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .plato-gate-cta-price {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .plato-gate-cta-amount {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .plato-gate-cta-currency {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: system-ui, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  }

  .plato-gate-cta:hover {
    background-color: #32a398;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    border-bottom: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(50, 163, 152, 0.35);
  }
</style>
